  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Master&apos;s Degree Program in Marine Fishery(2023)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through practical training in scientific laboratories within STEM disciplines such as aquaculture technology seafood processing technology and fisheries technology we offer specialized technical education in various aspects of the fisheries sector Our goal is to foster integrated competencies by linking these technical skills with social sciences including resource management and fisheries policy</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We aim to share South Korea&apos;s accumulated experience and competitive technology in the field of fisheries development with developing countries and to provide capacity-building education for the sustainable development of their fisheries sector&#xC591;&#xC2DD;&#xBD84;&#xC57C; &#xAE30;&#xC220;, &#xC815;&#xCC45;, &#xC5F0;&#xAD6C; &#xC5ED;&#xB7C9; &#xAC15;&#xD654;&#xB97C; &#xD1B5;&#xD574; &#xC8FC;&#xC694; &#xB2E8;&#xBC31;&#xC9C8;&#xC6D0;&#xC778; &#xC591;&#xC2DD; &#xC218;&#xC0B0;&#xBB3C;&#xC758; &#xC591;&#xC801; &#xD655;&#xB300; &#xBC0F; &#xC591;&#xC2DD; &#xD488;&#xC885; &#xB2E4;&#xC591;&#xD654;&#xB97C; &#xD1B5;&#xD574; &#xC2DD;&#xB7C9; &#xBB38;&#xC81C;&#xD574;&#xACB0; &#xBC0F; &#xACBD;&#xC81C;&#xC801; &#xC774;&#xC724;&#xC744; &#xCC3D;&#xCD9C; &#xD560; &#xC218; &#xC788;&#xB294; &#xD504;&#xB85C;&#xC81D;&#xD2B8;&#xB97C; &#xAC1C;&#xBC1C;&#xD558;&#xACE0; &#xC815;&#xCC45;&#xC744; &#xC218;&#xB9BD;&#xD568;</narrative>
  </description>
